<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: 'ERP para Jardinagem' }) %>
  <style>
    .landing-hero {
      padding: 100px 0 80px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }
    .landing-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -40%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 700px;
      height: 500px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(107, 181, 54, 0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .landing-hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .landing-hero h1 em {
      font-style: normal;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    .landing-features { padding: 60px 0 80px; }
    .landing-feature-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: var(--space-7);
      transition: border-color var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
                  transform   var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out),
                  box-shadow  var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
      height: 100%;
    }
    .landing-feature-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }
    .landing-feature-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    }
    .landing-feature-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: var(--text-md);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    }
    .landing-feature-card p {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: var(--leading-loose);
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .landing-hero { padding: 64px 0 48px; }
      .landing-hero h1 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="background: var(--bg);">

  <nav style="padding: var(--space-5) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
    <div class="container d-flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="sidebar-logo">
        <div class="sidebar-logo-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 20h10"/>
            <path d="M10 20c5.5-2.5.8-6.4 3-10"/>
            <path d="M9.5 9.4c1.1.8 1.8 2.2 2.3 3.7-2 .4-3.5.4-4.8-.3-1.2-.6-2.3-1.9-3-4.2 2.8-.5 4.4 0 5.5.8z"/>
            <path d="M14.1 6a7 7 0 0 0-1.1 4c1.9-.1 3.3-.6 4.3-1.4 1-1 1.6-2.3 1.7-4.6-2.7.1-4 1-4.9 2z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="sidebar-logo-text">Plantech</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">
        Acessar Sistema
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="landing-hero">
    <div class="container" style="position: relative; z-index: 1;">
      <div style="max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Carrapicho Jardinagem</p>
        <h1>Gestao que <em>cultiva</em> resultados</h1>
        <p style="font-size: var(--text-md); color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-7); line-height: var(--leading-loose);">
          Estoque, vendas e financeiro integrados em um ERP feito para quem trabalha com a terra.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex gap-sm justify-content-center" style="flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Comecar agora
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="#recursos" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">
            Conhecer recursos
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="landing-features" id="recursos">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="landing-feature-card">
            <div class="landing-feature-icon" style="background: var(--accent-subtle); color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);">
              <i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i>
            </div>
            <h3>Estoque inteligente</h3>
            <p>Controle LIFO com entrada e saida automatica, alertas de reposicao e rastreio por categoria.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="landing-feature-card">
            <div class="landing-feature-icon" style="background: var(--earth-subtle); color: var(--earth); border: 1px solid var(--earth-border);">
              <i class="bi bi-cart3"></i>
            </div>
            <h3>PDV integrado</h3>
            <p>Ponto de venda agil com baixa automatica, desconto, multiplas formas de pagamento e cupom fiscal.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="landing-feature-card">
            <div class="landing-feature-icon" style="background: var(--info-subtle); color: var(--info); border: 1px solid rgba(74, 144, 217, 0.2);">
              <i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line"></i>
            </div>
            <h3>Relatorios e DRE</h3>
            <p>Vendas, saidas, estoque e financeiro com export PDF. Visao gerencial em tempo real.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer style="padding: var(--space-7) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: var(--text-sm);">
        &copy; 2025 Plantech Systems &middot; Carrapicho Jardinagem &middot; Rondon, PR
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
